                <pb facs="0286" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 184.82/2: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate Peace to the Acting
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-23">December 23,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>76. [From Lansing.] Your 67 December 20th 2:00 p.m. The matter dealt with by the
                    Associated Press under date of December 18th mentioned in your telegram has not
                    been discussed here. Lansing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi> [<hi rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>]
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
